{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02512",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 7.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.17,
      "end_seconds": 15.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 19.81,
      "end_seconds": 24.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "good morning, doctor i came along to to help out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.1,
      "end_seconds": 29.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.17,
      "end_seconds": 34.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I wanted to get being very confused looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.25,
      "end_seconds": 38.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.99,
      "end_seconds": 58.93,
      "duration_seconds": 18.94,
      "text": "ah, it's been going on for about a month i've never really been one for hospitals i've, I've also had bone pain, for about two weeks oh, and severe thirst and passing lots of urine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.94,
      "end_seconds": 61.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Have you had vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.79,
      "end_seconds": 69.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "yes, about the same, four weeks. About vomiting, it's a few times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.09,
      "end_seconds": 75.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.79,
      "end_seconds": 80.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "yes, naproxen i get a rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.75,
      "end_seconds": 85.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.33,
      "end_seconds": 100.77,
      "duration_seconds": 14.44,
      "text": "I've had heart disease, yes. I took the morning off to come in today. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I've had high cholesterol, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.92,
      "end_seconds": 113.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.12,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high cholesterol in your file as well. Which medicines do you take at the moment? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.96,
      "end_seconds": 121.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Metoprolol. I take it it 50 milligrams, twice a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 122.23,
      "end_seconds": 130.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "It's meant to be twice a day, though I don't see she take it every time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.43,
      "end_seconds": 137.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "Rosuvastatin i take it 10 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 139.44,
      "end_seconds": 148.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the rosuvastatin was 5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.63,
      "end_seconds": 153.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.39,
      "end_seconds": 158.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "no, I left it at home"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.77,
      "end_seconds": 170.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.14,
      "end_seconds": 176.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.34,
      "end_seconds": 178.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.07,
      "end_seconds": 181.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.09,
      "end_seconds": 183.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.34,
      "end_seconds": 188.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.06,
      "end_seconds": 192.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.16,
      "end_seconds": 197.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.28,
      "end_seconds": 202.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.61,
      "end_seconds": 206.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.46,
      "end_seconds": 218.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "any fever or fall at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.86,
      "end_seconds": 221.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.65,
      "end_seconds": 225.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Right, did you notice any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.45,
      "end_seconds": 229.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Not at all, no chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.97,
      "end_seconds": 233.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.26,
      "end_seconds": 236.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.68,
      "end_seconds": 239.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.64,
      "end_seconds": 243.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.43,
      "end_seconds": 247.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.93,
      "end_seconds": 258.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "that's it, just a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.98,
      "end_seconds": 282.74,
      "duration_seconds": 14.76,
      "text": "okay: weight 72 kilos, pressure 96 over 61. And height 184 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temperature is 36.5 degrees, BMI works out to 21.3, heart rate 109."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.42,
      "end_seconds": 285.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Is that that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.88,
      "end_seconds": 289.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.06,
      "end_seconds": 294.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.41,
      "end_seconds": 296.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.81,
      "end_seconds": 320.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "You are dehydrated and drowsy with a slow, odd rhythm on the monitor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.63,
      "end_seconds": 325.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.97,
      "end_seconds": 343.79,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with a high calcium emergency. We shouldn't forget a kidney failure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.66,
      "end_seconds": 348.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.65,
      "end_seconds": 367.98,
      "duration_seconds": 18.33,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a high calcium emergency do well once it's treated properly. Just to be sure I understood. You've had being very confused for about a month, and no chest pain or fall"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.73,
      "end_seconds": 371.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "that's what happened, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.72,
      "end_seconds": 380.34,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Let's book an ECG to look into hypercalcaemia. Let's book urgent blood tests to look into confusion and polyuria."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.21,
      "end_seconds": 384.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 386.41,
      "end_seconds": 418.9,
      "duration_seconds": 32.49,
      "text": "I'll start you on sodium chloride 0.9%, 1 litre, over one hour, single dose. That's for dehydration. You need hospital fluids and treatment now. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. Let's get you seen by the emergency team, I'll arrange the letter. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.96,
      "end_seconds": 425.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "let's plan a check straight away does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.29,
      "end_seconds": 429.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.52,
      "end_seconds": 431.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}